            SPC flooring earns its reputation when the job is matched to the product: a flat subfloor, a stated temperature range, an attached pad you do not double up, and a wear layer sized to your traffic. Get those four right and nearly any of the lines above will give you a stable, waterproof floor that outlasts the trend cycle.
          </p>
